        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Manninen, Martha Coolidge, Julia Stiles, Luke Mably, Ben Miller, Miranda Richardson, James Fox, Alberta Watson, Peter Stebbings\n- Products: The Prince and Me, Separation\n- Topics: Canadian film, television, and stage acting; film release\n\nFacts:\n- Sarah Manninen was born on November 6, 1976 in Waterloo, Ontario.\n- Sarah Manninen is a Canadian film, television, and stage actress.\n- The Prince and Me is a 2004 romantic comedy film directed by Martha Coolidge.\n- The Prince and Me stars Julia Stiles, Luke Mably, Ben Miller, Miranda Richardson, James Fox, and Alberta Watson.\n- Sarah Manninen is known for appearing in the film The Prince and Me and the series The Line.\n- Separation was released on video on demand on April 15, 2013.\n- Separation stars Sarah Manninen and Peter Stebbings as a married couple struggling to save their lives and their marriage.",
